  _descriptionText: 'Mandala painting game with pattern repetition and various painting
    tools to choose from.


    - Choose a mandala and paint one segment of a ring
    after which the same texture is applied to the rest of the ring one by one for
    a satisfying effect.'
  _developmentHighlights:
  - Name: 
    Text: Texture repetition system for each mandala ring after player finished the
      painting of one segment
